### ==============================================================================
### ShopSphere Microservices - HTTP Test Requests
### All requests route through the API Gateway on port 5000 or to direct service ports.
### ==============================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:5000
@authUrl = http://localhost:5001
@productUrl = http://localhost:5002
@orderUrl = http://localhost:5003
@paymentUrl = http://localhost:5004
@notificationUrl = http://localhost:5005

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. API Gateway Aggregated Health Check
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Auth Service Endpoints (via Gateway /api/auth)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name registerUser
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eleanor Vance",
  "email": "eleanor.vance@shopsphere.artisan",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "customer"
}

###

# @name loginUser
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "eleanor.vance@shopsphere.artisan",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token for authenticated requests
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### Verify JWT Token
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Refresh JWT Token
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Product Service Endpoints (via Gateway /api/products)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get All Products
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Filter Products by Category
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products?category=Ceramics%20%26%20Tableware
Accept: application/json

### Search Products
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products?search=leather
Accept: application/json

### Get All Categories
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Product by Slug or ID
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/terracotta-hand-thrown-pourer
Accept: application/json

### Create New Product
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Cast Bronze Paperweight",
  "price": 48.00,
  "category": "Stationery & Study",
  "stock": 30,
  "description": "Solid sand-cast bronze prism, patinated with traditional green verdigris.",
  "images": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585336261026-7f55f284e3a8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
  ],
  "attributes": {
    "Weight": "420g",
    "Material": "Solid architectural bronze",
    "Origin": "Kyoto, Japan"
  }
}

### Adjust Product Stock (Triggers RabbitMQ stock.updated event)
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/terracotta-hand-thrown-pourer/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10,
  "reason": "RESTOCK"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Order Service Endpoints (via Gateway /api/orders)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create Order (Publishes order.created to RabbitMQ)
# @name createOrder
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "customerName": "Eleanor Vance",
  "customerEmail": "eleanor.vance@shopsphere.artisan",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "terracotta-hand-thrown-pourer",
      "productName": "Terracotta Hand-Thrown Pourer",
      "price": 68.00,
      "quantity": 2,
      "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612196808214-b8e1d6145a8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "742 Evergreen Terrace",
    "city": "Portland",
    "state": "OR",
    "postalCode": "97201",
    "country": "United States"
  }
}

### Store Order ID
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### Fetch All Orders (Filtered by user ID extracted from JWT)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Fetch Single Order with Items
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Payment Service Endpoints (via Gateway /api/payments)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Fetch All Payments Ledger
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Process Payment Directly (Alternative to automatic order.created event)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "userId": "usr_test_123",
  "customerEmail": "eleanor.vance@shopsphere.artisan",
  "amount": 136.00,
  "paymentMethod": "card_stripe_simulated",
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Notification Service Endpoints (via Gateway /api/notifications)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Email Delivery Logs & Live Preview URLs
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/notifications
Accept: application/json
